lty achieves only 28.5% at 30% target, creating unfair comparison with TEAL at 30%.\n\n## Your task\n\nReact to R1's review. For each of R1's key points:\n1. Do you agree or disagree? Why?\n2. Are there points R1 raised that make you want to adjust your own score?\n3. Are there points from your review that R1 missed or underweighted?\n\nAlso consider:\n- Is the gap between your scores (3.0 vs 3.5) justified? What drives it?\n- Would you move your score in either direction after reading R1's review?\n\nKeep response under 500 words. Be specific about agreements/disagreements.","model":"opus"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3188,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7674,"cache_read_input_tokens":56222,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7674},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"20b0e106-df0c-43c4-9dfa-fa82e00c09d1","uuid":"56f35077-319d-4861-b71b-b0886de54cba"}
